  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the spirit of the wild with the Customized Wolf Quilt by Jeminise. This beautiful Western-style bedding features a Native American inspired design showcasing a powerful wolf head inside a circular frame with geometric patterns and feathers, making it a perfect functional and decorative piece for any bedroom, living room couch, or outdoor adventure.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customized Design:</strong> Features a customizable name option to create a truly unique and personalized gift for wolf lovers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>High-Quality Print:</strong> Showcases an intricate Native American inspired illustration of a wolf with striking blue eyes and traditional geometric motifs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Comfort:</strong> Made from a breathable and durable polyester-cotton blend that keeps you cool in summer and warm in winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor snugging while reading or watching TV, as well as outdoor activities like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water, drying quickly to remain soft and fluffy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Available in versatile size options including Throw, Twin, Full, Queen, and King to suit your bedding needs.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton, Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Indian Wolf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Western</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Native American inspired</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt, 2 pillow covers (optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
